# Remote state backend (recommended for teams)

Uncomment and configure before using shared Terraform state in CI/CD.

```hcl
terraform {
  backend "azurerm" {
    resource_group_name  = "rg-scad-tfstate"
    storage_account_name = "scadtstate"
    container_name       = "tfstate"
    key                  = "scad.tfstate"
  }
}
```

Use separate keys per environment:

- `scad-staging.tfstate`
- `scad-production.tfstate`
